  "job_B21.2.1.1.2_20251003_114536": {
    "chunk_text": "bind on Gif li\u00feule utyrne genim wermod & gecnua, do on teoro, cl\u00e6m on & bind on f\u00e6ste. Wi\u00fe feferadle, elehtran, gy\u00ferife, wegbr\u00e6de, gecnua on ealu, l\u00e6t standan twa niht, sele drincan. Wi\u00fe fefre eft, betonican drince swi\u00f0e & ete \u00fereo sn\u00e6da. Eft, drinc on hluttrum eala\u00f0 wermod, gy\u00ferifan, betonican, bisceopwyrt, fenminte bogen, sio clufihte Drenc wi\u00fe \u00feon, betonican, springwyrt, attorla\u00f0e, berbine, eofor\u00ferote, hundestunge, dreorgedwostle, Wi\u00f0 \u00feriddan d\u00e6ges fefre, on wearmum w\u00e6tre drince betonican tyn sopan \u00feonne to wille. Wi\u00f0 feor\u00fean d\u00e6ges fefre drince wegbr\u00e6dan seaw on swetum w\u00e6tre twam tidum \u00e6r him se fefer to Wi\u00fe \u00e6lces d\u00e6ges fefere drince on cealdum w\u00e6tere betonican dustes \u00fe\u00e6t \u00e6nne pening gewege, o\u00feer Wi\u00fe fefre eft hylp\u00f0 syndrigo marubie to drincanne. Wi\u00fe lenctenadle, wermod, eofor\u00ferote, elehtre, wegbr\u00e6de, ribbe, cerfille, attorla\u00f0e, feferfuge, \u00deis mon sceal writan on husldisce & on \u00feone drenc nid halig w\u00e6tere \u00fewean & singan on, In & \u00feriwa \u00feonne onsupe \u00fe\u00e6s w\u00e6teres swelces gehw\u00e6\u00feer \u00feara manna. Wi\u00fe feond seocum men \u00feonne deofol \u00feone monnan fede o\u00f0\u00f0e hine innan gewealde mid adle, Drenc wi\u00fe feond",
